name: Exact file queries and findings from an inactive immutable context
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/exact-filter-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 3 of 3 | literal-filter
expect: src/a  b.tf
expect: src/scope#L7.tf
expect: src/`tag`.tf
submit: findings filter file:unrelated.tf
require-live-snap: 20 1 of 1 | original-filter
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | selected-context
expect: Selected paths
keys: v
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | selected-diagram
expect: Selected paths client
expect: f findings
resize: 160x48
live-snap: diagram-160x48
expect: f findings
resize: 96x89
live-snap: diagram-96x89
expect: f findings
resize: 80x24
live-snap: diagram-80x24
expect: f findings
resize: 60x20
live-snap: diagram-60x20
expect: f findings
resize: 40x12
live-snap: diagram-40x12
expect: f findings
expect: Esc context
expect: Enter details
ask: Are selected context, element navigation, findings and return controls clear at every size, without suggesting context activation?
resize: 120x36
keys: Down Enter End f
require-live-snap: 20 3 of 3 | selected-findings
expect: src/a  b.tf
expect: src/scope#L7.tf
expect: src/`tag`.tf
expect: Path matches span saved revisions
resize: 160x48
live-snap: findings-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: findings-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: findings-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: findings-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: findings-40x12
expect: saved revisions
expect: q diagram
ask: Does the queue communicate exact path matches across saved revisions while preserving individual observation and verdict authority?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | restored-details
expect: Selected paths
expect: src/scope#L7.tf
expect: src/a  b.tf
keys: Enter Down Down f
require-live-snap: 20 3 of 3 | flow-findings
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | restored-flow
keys: Down Down f
require-live-snap: 20 3 of 3 | boundary-findings
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | restored-boundary
keys: Up Up Up Up Up f
require-live-snap: 20 repository file evidence | missing-evidence
expect: CONTEXT DATA FLOW
expect: Esc context
keys: Enter
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
live-snap: missing-details-40x12
expect: Select a component
expect: f findings
expect: Esc context
ask: Do failures remain inside the selected context, with a readable reason and a clear return path, without creating work?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restored-context
expect: Selected paths
keys: q Escape
require-live-snap: 20 OPTIONS | restored-options
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 20 1 of 1 | restored-original-filter
expect: file:unrelated.tf
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART navigated
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | restarted-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restarted-context
expect: Selected paths
keys: v
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT DATA FLOW | restarted-diagram
expect: Selected paths
keys: Down f
require-live-snap: 20 3 of 3 | restarted-findings
expect: src/a  b.tf
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/dfd_context_findings.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does a fresh no-color session reproduce findings from the selected inactive revision, with the active context and allowance unchanged?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
